*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CLM0006
*> PURPOSE : INSURANCE CLAIMS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-09-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 780
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CLMNIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0006.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> CLAIM TYPE A=AUTO H=HOME M=MEDICAL
    05 CLAIM-TYPE         PIC X.
    05 CLM-AMOUNT         PIC 9(7)V99.
    *> POLICY DEDUCTIBLE
    05 POLICY-DEDUCT      PIC 9(5)V99.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 SETTLE-AMT         PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
    *> A=APPROVE I=INVESTIGATE D=DENY
    05 CLAIM-STATUS       PIC X VALUE 'A'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM CALC-PAYOUT
    DISPLAY "SETTLE-AMT=" SETTLE-AMT
    DISPLAY "CLAIM-STATUS=" CLAIM-STATUS
    STOP RUN.
CALC-PAYOUT.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> MEDICAL CO-INSURANCE
        WHEN CLAIM-TYPE EQUAL TO 'M'
            COMPUTE SETTLE-AMT = CLM-AMOUNT * 0.70
        *> DEDUCTIBLE APPLIES
        WHEN CLM-AMOUNT GREATER THAN 0
            COMPUTE SETTLE-AMT = CLM-AMOUNT - POLICY-DEDUCT
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0 TO SETTLE-AMT
            MOVE 'D' TO CLAIM-STATUS
    END-EVALUATE.
